OL,3,GNEWSA'Devoted' assistance dog always by
OL,4,Aowner's side
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn assistance dog who helped his owner
OL,7,Favoid accidents and medical emergencies
OL,8,Ffor eight years has received an award.
OL,10,FNine-year-old black labrador Rowley,
OL,11,Ffrom Surrey, has been awarded a PDSA
OL,12,Fcommendation for supporting owner
OL,13,FMegan, who lives with multiple
OL,14,Fdisabilities.
OL,16,FHe has alerted Megan, who has visual
OL,17,Fimpairment, profound hearing loss in
OL,18,Fone ear, mobility difficulties and
OL,19,FCrohn's disease, to more than 6,000
OL,20,Fmedical episodes during their time
OL,21,Ftogether, the PDSA said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
