OL,3,GNEWSA'Devoted' assistance dog always by
OL,4,Aowner's side
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Everything I've achieved over the last
OL,7,Feight years has only been possible
OL,8,Fbecause Rowley has been by my side
OL,9,Fevery step of the way," Megan said.
